      "id": 140256,
      "name": "Matchstickman",
      "username": "Matchstickman",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/matchstickman/{size}/1880_2.png",
      "created_at": "2015-04-17T13:40:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>This is exactly the issue I brought up when the game was first being floated here (though i might have said it in a G+ game rather than here on the forums), but I was thinking further ahead to Nightmist and Oblivion.</p><p>I would much rather have a \"for the rest of this action\" that can be selected at any point (like the current \"choose for me\" button), that way you can do targets with resistances/DR first and then everyone else in a job lot and not accidentally do extra damage if you get to do more damage later in the turn (through a power or second card play for example).</p>",
      "post_number": 3,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T04:17:08.125Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
