      "created_at": "2015-04-17T19:27:26.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Against Advanced Plague Rat and Advanced Spite, I used a combo of Twist the Ether and Flesh of the Sun God to make them non-threats (along with Imbued Fire against Plague Rat)... But clicking on Fire every time they dealt damage was certainly annoying, especially with how many instances of damage Spite has.</p>",
