      "id": 140259,
      "name": "ViolentSilence",
      "username": "ViolentSilence",
      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/v/bbe5ce/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2015-04-19T13:42:05.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Glad someone else raised this, I was going to! What prompted this for me was a combo of Lead From The Front, Next Evolution and Twist The Ether vas Spite (making Legacy immune to Toxic, then redirecting all damage from other heroes to Legacy after turning it to toxic). What made that drag a bit was having to pick a damage type, chose to redirect, and then pick a damage type again. It'd be nice to set a 'recipe' and have it repeat where applicable, or maybe chose to follow it or not (at which point you'd go back to the regular routine)</p>",
      "post_number": 6,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T04:17:08.332Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
